


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_0e6cee3f:


    "众人上床后没多久，圣夜子已经酣然入梦。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_9501c735:



    voice "2RI_0672"
    rin "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_177fcaec:


    "伦翻书的时候低哼了一声。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_63ea1809:



    voice "2HI_0660"
    hina "「伦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_2cf758bf:


    "阳菜听到了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_eb62dbab:



    voice "2RI_0673"
    rin "「嗯？你还醒着啊，真难得」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_d3617db8:



    voice "2HI_0661"
    hina "「嗯。比起这个，怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_115b4958:



    voice "2RI_0674"
    rin "「啊啊，手指有点痛。伤口被书页划到了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_6e682733:



    voice "2HI_0662"
    hina "「手指的伤——是被我咬伤的那个吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_6ed5eb2c:



    voice "2RI_0675"
    rin "「嗯。好像肿了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_2e49f4cb:



    voice "2HI_0663"
    hina "「……对不起」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_7ead2408:


    "阳菜很歉疚，在被窝里缩紧了身子。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_6ae1631c:



    voice "2RI_0676"
    rin "「毕竟没有好好处理伤口嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_75fa44d4:



    voice "2HI_0664"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_6fa5ff5a:



    voice "2RI_0677"
    rin "「呜呜……好痛。这样下去可能会得狂犬病～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_1223f2ca:



    voice "2HI_0665"
    hina "「啊哇哇……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_f4c274c4:


    "伦摆出很夸张的痛苦表情，但阳菜却当了真，分分秒要哭出来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_74e2315f:



    voice "2HI_0666"
    hina "「都怪我……伦的手指可能要没了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_72077c15:


    "阳菜已经有了哭腔，伦这才意识到自己玩笑开过火了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_f46c8271:



    voice "2RI_0678"
    rin "「啊，不是……我开玩笑的啦？舔一舔很快就能治好了……我舔……好痛！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_ba251312:


    "似乎渗到伤口里去了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_fa492bc8:



    voice "2HI_0667"
    hina "「啊啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_a717b07c:



    voice "2RI_0679"
    rin "「不要紧的啦。我去找祥子姐拿药和创口贴——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_247a2ad8:


    "伦正打算起身下床——"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_45cbe81d:



    voice "2HI_0668"
    hina "「我这就去！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_ef7ca952:


    "但阳菜先一步从床上弹了出去，下一步就已经飞出房间外了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_86a35eda:



    voice "2RI_0680"
    rin "「哦哦……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_5b8bb220:



    voice "2FU_0537"
    fumi "「绪方同学？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_49760665:



    voice "2RI_0681"
    rin "「啊，好的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_7d711ad1:



    voice "2FU_0538"
    fumi "「这样不行哦。夏目同学直来直往，凡事都会当真的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_2ac0f229:



    voice "2RI_0682"
    rin "「呃、不是、我只是想逗她一下……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_03a72435:



    voice "2FU_0539"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_1ec86bc8:



    voice "2RI_0683"
    rin "「……对不起」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_d7f8dbe8:



    voice "2FU_0540"
    fumi "「应该去和夏目同学道歉而不是我」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_03_3379b102:



    voice "2RI_0684"
    rin "「……嗯」"
